// Terrain types of the gameplay grid (WP2.1). Read by sf_data::terrain.
//
// A map's terrain layer (`terrain.png`, one pixel per 4 m gameplay cell, B12)
// holds the `id` of one of these types for every cell. The ids are what is
// stored in map files, so never renumber a type that a map uses; add new ones
// with a new id. The names are what the map generator, the tools and the cost
// tables of unit_classes.ron use.
//
// A type has two flags of its own: `buildable` (read by building placement,
// WP6.x, and already by the sim's Place command) and `harvestable` (read by
// the economy, phase 7). Which movement classes can cross a type, and how
// fast, is NOT a property of the type: it is the `terrain_costs` of each
// movement class in unit_classes.ron (WP4.1), which has to name every type
// here. The flags are documented in docs/rules/terrain.md, the costs in
// docs/rules/movement.md.
//
// `minimap_colour` (WP2.3) is the flat sRGB colour of the type on the minimap.
// It is presentation only; the sim never reads it. The materials of the 3D
// terrain per type (WP2.2) are mapped separately. A test requires every pair of
// colours to differ clearly, so a new type needs a colour that stands out from
// the others (and from the dark minimap frame).
(
    types: [
        (
            id: 0,
            name: "grass",
            buildable: true,
            harvestable: false,
            minimap_colour: (86, 140, 66),
        ),
        (
            id: 1,
            name: "road",
            buildable: false,
            harvestable: false,
            minimap_colour: (206, 184, 132),
        ),
        (
            id: 2,
            name: "water",
            buildable: false,
            harvestable: false,
            minimap_colour: (44, 96, 172),
        ),
        (
            id: 3,
            name: "rock",
            buildable: false,
            harvestable: false,
            minimap_colour: (104, 104, 112),
        ),
        (
            id: 4,
            name: "ore",
            buildable: false,
            harvestable: true,
            minimap_colour: (236, 170, 36),
        ),
        (
            id: 5,
            name: "bridge",
            buildable: false,
            harvestable: false,
            minimap_colour: (122, 72, 40),
        ),
    ],
)
